<hr class="separator" />
<section id="vision" style="padding:6rem 2rem;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
  <!-- Section Heading Wash Glow (Positioned in top negative space clear of text) -->
  <div style="position:absolute;top:-40px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:100%;max-width:700px;height:140px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 40% at 50% 0%,rgba(139,92,246,0.06),transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;z-index:0;"></div>
  <div style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2rem;align-items:center;">
    <h2 class="section-headline">The control plane for <span class="accent">AI-generated software</span></h2>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem;text-align:center;">
      <p class="section-para" style="font-size:1.125rem;color:#a1a1aa;">
        Software creation is becoming nearly free. Software operations are becoming the bottleneck.
      </p>
      <p class="section-para" style="font-size:0.9375rem;">
        GitHub became where source code lives. Docker became the runtime for containers. Kubernetes became the control plane for containers.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:#fff;font-weight:500;line-height:1.7;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;">
        Nixora aims to become the control plane where AI-generated software lives: one place to deploy, manage, govern, secure, update, and eventually retire every application any AI coding agent creates.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
